  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Fragrance Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Long-wearing</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean at Sephora</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>What it is: </b>A buildable cream eyeshadow for a sheer wash of color—now in two finishes.<br><br><b>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></b>- Jojoba Extract: For a smooth, blendable cream texture.<br>- Microfine Pearls: Give a multidimensional wash of color.  <br><br><b>Ingredient Callouts:</b> This product is vegan.<br><br><b>What Else You Need to Know:</b> This buildable, cream eyeshadow gives a sheer wash of color that wears comfortably all day with zero creasing or fallout. Available in both a matte and pearlescent sheen finish, the blendable formula glides on easily and sets to a smooth finish. Wear it alone or layered for added depth.</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-For a sheer wash of color, swipe once across the eyelid or layer for added depth. <br>-Wear alone or on top of Solo Shadow Matte for added dimension (sold separately). <br>-Blend using Brush No. 2 (sold separately) or your finger. <br>-When finished, screw the cap on tightly to close.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Jojoba Extract: For a smooth, blendable cream texture. <br>-Microfine Pearls: Give a multidimensional wash of color. <br><br>Isododecane, Trimethylsiloxysilicate, Synthetic Fluorphlogopite, Jojoba Esters, Dimethicone, Sucrose Tetrastearate Triacetate, Hydrogenated Polycyclopentadiene, Polyglyceryl-2 Triisostearate, Dimethicone/Vinyl Dimethicone Crosspolymer, Polyhydroxystearic Acid, Mica, Polyphenylsilsesquioxane, Coco-Caprylate/Caprate, Trioctyldodecyl Citrate, Dimethicone Crosspolymer, Ethylhexylglycerin, Triethoxycaprylylsilane, Tin Oxide; May Contain/Peut Contenir (+/-): CI 77891 (Titanium Dioxide), CI 77163 (Bismuth Oxychloride), CI 77491 / CI 77499 / CI 77492 (Iron Oxides), CI 77742 (Manganese Violet).<br>The list of ingredients is subject to change. Please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</div></details>",
